     1650     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
     1651   END.
     1652   ON CHOOSE OF b-arh IN FRAME D-Dialog
     1653   DO:
     1654     run read-arh in this-procedure no-error.
     1655     if error-status :error then do:
     1656       return no-apply.
     1657     end.
     1658   END.
     1659   ON CHOOSE OF b-goods IN FRAME D-Dialog
